.h{font-size:1em;color:#1A1A1A;border-bottom:0.6pt solid #1A1A1A;padding-bottom:1pt;}
</style></head><body class="t-classic">
<div class="hd">
<h1 class="name">Alex Morgan</h1>
<p class="headline">Operations Coordinator</p>
<p class="contact"><span class="nw">Milwaukee, WI</span> · <span class="nw">alex.morgan@example.com</span> · <span class="nw">+1 555 0142</span> · <span class="nw">linkedin.com/in/alex-morgan-example</span></p>
<div class="clr"></div>
</div>
<section class="s"><div class="k">
<h2 class="h">SUMMARY</h2>
<p class="t">Operations coordinator with six years in logistics and customer service. I like turning messy processes into simple routines and measuring whether they work.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="s">
<div class="k">
<h2 class="h">EXPERIENCE</h2>
<div class="e">
<p class="eh"><b>Operations Coordinator</b>, Harbourline Logistics, Milwaukee, WI</p>
<p class="dt"><i>Apr 2021 – Present</i></p>
<p class="b">• Built 6 Excel dashboards that the depot uses every morning to plan 40 delivery routes</p>
<p class="b">• Reduced late deliveries from 9% to 4% by changing the loading order and cut-off times</p>
<p class="b">• Coordinated 3 carriers and 12 drivers during the peak season</p>
<p class="b">• Introduced a weekly review of delivery data with the dispatch team</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="e">
<p class="eh"><b>Customer Service Team Lead</b>, BrightCart, Milwaukee, WI</p>
<p class="dt"><i>Feb 2018 – Mar 2021</i></p>
<p class="b">• Led a team of 7 agents handling 400 orders and complaints a day</p>
<p class="b">• Raised customer satisfaction from 86% to 93% in 18 months</p>
<p class="b">• Wrote 30 help articles that reduced repeat contacts by 15%</p>
</div>
<div class="e">
<p class="eh"><b>Barista</b>, Corner Roast Café, Madison, WI</p>
<p class="dt"><i>Sep 2016 – Jan 2018</i></p>
<p class="b">• Served up to 250 customers per shift</p>
<p class="b">• Trained 4 new baristas</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="s">
<div class="k">
<h2 class="h">PROJECTS</h2>
<div class="e">
<p class="eh"><b>Late delivery analysis</b></p>
<p class="dt"><i>2023</i></p>
<p class="t">Personal project with public city traffic data.</p>
<p class="b">• Analyzed 18 months of delivery times with SQL and Power BI and found 3 avoidable delay patterns</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="s">
<div class="k">
<h2 class="h">VOLUNTEERING</h2>
<div class="e">
<p class="eh"><b>Route planning volunteer</b>, Lakeside Food Bank</p>
<p class="dt"><i>2022 – Present</i></p>
<p class="b">• Planned weekly routes for 9 volunteer drivers serving 120 families</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="s">
<div class="k">
<h2 class="h">EDUCATION</h2>
<div class="e">
<p class="eh"><b>Associate Degree in Business Administration</b>, Milwaukee Area Technical College</p>
<p class="dt"><i>2014 – 2016</i></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="s">
<div class="k">
<h2 class="h">SKILLS</h2>
<div class="e">
<p class="eh"><b>Tools:</b> Excel (pivot tables, XLOOKUP), Power BI, SQL (basic), Google Workspace</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="e">
<p class="eh"><b>Methods:</b> Process improvement, Lean basics, Stakeholder communication</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="s">
<div class="k">
<h2 class="h">LANGUAGES</h2>
<div class="e">
<p class="eh"><b>English</b> – Native</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="e">
<p class="eh"><b>Spanish</b> – Conversational</p>
</div>
</section>
</body></html>"
`;

